# Local working state, never part of the published document.
#
# `.preview/` held 13 MB of screenshots for months, ignored only by this
# machine's `.git/info/exclude` — a file that is not versioned and therefore not
# shared. A second person putting screenshots in the same directory would have
# committed them into a 1.2 MB repository. The ignore rule belongs where the
# repository can carry it.

.preview/
.task-pipeline/

# Python bytecode. `negatives.py` imports `check-render.py` to ask whether a
# browser is present, and importing writes here.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Audit and render byproducts
*.pdf
!docs/**/*.pdf

# macOS / editor litter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
